{"id":"n62286-1-26","stage":1,"title":"나타나다 · 出现","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62286-1-26-1","ko":"실례지만 이 근처에 슈퍼가 있나요?","zh":"不好意思，请问这附近有超市吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"실례지만","meaning":"失礼","explanation":"실례：失礼；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"실례","audio":"/audio/a093e7a78337b547c773.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26872","senseId":"1","lemma":"실례","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실례지만","audio":"/audio/3efe88baa668f1b42f8b.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"근처에","meaning":"附近，近处","explanation":"근처：附近，近处；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"근처","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62061","senseId":"1","lemma":"근처","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"근처에","audio":"/audio/fd4c3e06470f8b90c75b.mp3"}},{"text":"슈퍼가","meaning":"超市","explanation":"슈퍼：超市；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"슈퍼","audio":"/audio/5f344ae3a2335e68103c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65285","senseId":"1","lemma":"슈퍼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"슈퍼가","audio":"/audio/91e0703f5bb1b903afc2.mp3"}},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나요","audio":"/audio/0eb260e471116d837abb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a093e7a78337b547","term":"실례","zh":"失礼","audio":"/audio/a093e7a78337b547c773.mp3","entryId":"26872","definition":"言行违背礼仪；或指那样的言行。","pronunciation":["실례"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"e44b07ac25b977cc","term":"근처","zh":"附近，近处","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3","entryId":"62061","definition":"以某场所、东西或人为中心，较近的地方。","pronunciation":["근ː처"]},{"id":"5f344ae3a2335e68","term":"슈퍼","zh":"超市","audio":"/audio/5f344ae3a2335e68103c.mp3","entryId":"65285","definition":"销售各种食物和生活必需品等的大型商店。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/2a5371f83023b46a080c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62286-1-26-2","ko":"네. 저 골목에서 오른쪽으로 돌면 슈퍼가 나타날 거예요.","zh":"有的。从那条胡同往右转，就能看到超市了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"골목에서","meaning":"巷子，胡同","explanation":"골목：巷子，胡同；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"골목","audio":"/audio/587e6d0cbedaf25ab43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18338","senseId":"1","lemma":"골목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"골목에서","audio":"/audio/8d111912ad5f54c3e8f5.mp3"}},{"text":"오른쪽으로","meaning":"右侧，右边","explanation":"오른쪽：右侧，右边；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"오른쪽","audio":"/audio/f594aa6a15b9381c0df7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17252","senseId":"1","lemma":"오른쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오른쪽으로","audio":"/audio/4fe8fc51ae3244e24c64.mp3"}},{"text":"돌면","meaning":"转，拐","explanation":"돌다：转，拐；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"돌다","audio":"/audio/2dc53ba2c5ff682d012f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75006","senseId":"19","lemma":"돌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌면","audio":"/audio/e3e59e28da73de92c5b2.mp3"}},{"text":"슈퍼가","meaning":"超市","explanation":"슈퍼：超市；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"슈퍼","audio":"/audio/5f344ae3a2335e68103c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65285","senseId":"1","lemma":"슈퍼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"슈퍼가","audio":"/audio/91e0703f5bb1b903afc2.mp3"}},{"text":"나타날","meaning":"出现，露面","explanation":"나타나다：出现，露面；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"나타나다","audio":"/audio/d6fb8e71960ac8027a14.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62286","senseId":"1","lemma":"나타나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나타날","audio":"/audio/b419131ccc4c6f4affea.mp3"}},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거예요","audio":"/audio/ce83694d33e9399b0229.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71215","definition":"用于指示与话者、听者离得很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"587e6d0cbedaf25a","term":"골목","zh":"巷子，胡同","audio":"/audio/587e6d0cbedaf25ab43f.mp3","entryId":"18338","definition":"两边有房屋的长而窄的街道。","pronunciation":["골ː목"]},{"id":"f594aa6a15b9381c","term":"오른쪽","zh":"右侧，右边","audio":"/audio/f594aa6a15b9381c0df7.mp3","entryId":"17252","definition":"人面向北边时和东边相同的一侧。","pronunciation":["오른쪽"]},{"id":"2dc53ba2c5ff682d","term":"돌다","zh":"转，拐","audio":"/audio/2dc53ba2c5ff682d012f.mp3","entryId":"75006","definition":"沿着路改变方向。","pronunciation":["돌ː다"]},{"id":"5f344ae3a2335e68","term":"슈퍼","zh":"超市","audio":"/audio/5f344ae3a2335e68103c.mp3","entryId":"65285","definition":"销售各种食物和生活必需品等的大型商店。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"d6fb8e71960ac802","term":"나타나다","zh":"出现，露面","audio":"/audio/d6fb8e71960ac8027a14.mp3","entryId":"62286","definition":"原本隐而不见的某个对象露出形貌。","pronunciation":["나타나다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/3c014cf274e2dd58adfc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.777,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62286","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":51,"sequenceScore":2.2277,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不好意思，请问这附近有超市吗？","有的。从那条胡同往右转，就能看到超市了。","你会游泳吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不好意思，请问这附近有超市吗？","有的。从那条胡同往右转，就能看到超市了。","你会游泳吗？"],"answer":1}]}
